{"name":"Polychrome","title":"Polychrome","revision":236704,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Polychrome","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The visual style of Polychrome is characterized by colors bursting/mixing together, usually over simple white/black backgrounds. This includes ink/liquid spills, powder explosions, smoke, paint smears and splatters, oil slicks, blended watercolors, plastic shimmers. etc. The palette uses a wide variety of color gradients, mostly blue, red, orange, yellow and turquoise."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Brands"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nintendo (DS and 3DS)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Playstation"},{"kind":"list","text":"Xbox"},{"kind":"list","text":"Windows"},{"kind":"list","text":"Vaio"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lenovo"},{"kind":"list","text":"Apple (iPod)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Nike"},{"kind":"list","text":"Adidas"},{"kind":"list","text":"Mio"},{"kind":"list","text":"Costco"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/4c/Original_67faab2f85a7202ce900528073d4e356.png/revision/latest?cb=20260209162919","caption":"Original 67faab2f85a7202ce900528073d4e356","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Original_67faab2f85a7202ce900528073d4e356.png","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0788-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/2/29/Original_cd2f3e7d3fe232940e42d6416c8045f8.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/1000?cb=20260209163659","caption":"Polychrome · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Original_cd2f3e7d3fe232940e42d6416c8045f8.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0788-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}